  "identifier": "fmriprep",
  "name": "fMRIPrep",
  "description": "Robust and reproducible preprocessing pipeline for functional MRI (fMRI) data. Accepts BIDS-formatted input and performs brain extraction, susceptibility distortion correction, motion correction, spatial normalisation, and surface projection with minimal manual intervention. Generates standardised derivatives and detailed visual QC reports. Part of the NiPreps ecosystem. Published in Nature Methods 2019.",
  "url": "https://fmriprep.org",
  "codeRepository": "https://github.com/nipreps/fmriprep",
